---
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
import SectionLabel from '../components/SectionLabel.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = 'Overcut™ — a collisionless competitive racer';
const description =
	'A serious, collisionless competitive racer where precise driving wins races and strategy determines who can sustain it. In development.';
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} path="/">
	<main>
		<Hero />

		<div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-6 sm:px-8">
			<section class="border-b border-line py-(--spacing-section)" aria-labelledby="what-it-is">
				<SectionLabel id="what-it-is" text="What it is" />

				<div class="mt-8 max-w-[62ch] space-y-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-fg sm:text-xl">
					<p>
						Overcut is a circuit racer. Cars never collide with one another, so a race
						is decided by where you place your car and how well you carry speed rather
						than by contact. Every car performs identically, which makes a lap time a
						statement about the driver and not about the garage.
					</p>
					<p>
						It is played only from inside the car. Abilities are part of it, and they
						only ever help you or a teammate — no ability exists to set a rival back.
						Exactly what those abilities do is still being designed, and this page is
						not going to pretend otherwise.
					</p>
					<p>
						None of that makes the game soft. Locked brakes, ruined tires and a missed
						pit box all cost you time. They cost it because of something you did, not
						because somebody did it to you.
					</p>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="py-(--spacing-section)" aria-labelledby="status">
				<SectionLabel id="status" text="Status" />

				<p class="mt-8 max-w-[62ch] text-lg leading-relaxed text-fg sm:text-xl">
					Overcut is in development. Development writing lives at <a
						class="text-accent-soft underline decoration-accent decoration-2 underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:text-fg"
						href="https://caseyirvine.dev">caseyirvine.dev</a
					>.
				</p>
			</section>
		</div>
	</main>

	<SiteFooter />
</BaseLayout>
